WEBVTT

00:16.224 --> 00:17.642
ALARM 6:00

00:30.363 --> 00:32.657
Every night, I recite the same prayer.

00:33.825 --> 00:35.994
Please, God, let me be sick.

00:38.455 --> 00:40.957
Please save me
from going to school tomorrow.

00:45.211 --> 00:46.963
Please let me fall asleep

00:47.047 --> 00:49.924
and wake up in two years
when I'll already have graduated.

00:54.179 --> 00:55.889
Death doesn't scare me anymore.

00:56.514 --> 00:58.266
-Good morning, miss.
-Good morning.

00:58.349 --> 00:59.684
The only thing I fear…

00:59.768 --> 01:01.352
You look great today.

01:01.853 --> 01:04.189
…is the hellish nightmare
that is my school.

01:05.398 --> 01:07.233
Hey, Dae-seok!

01:07.317 --> 01:09.611
-Hey, Dae-seok!
-Hey, get down from there!

01:09.694 --> 01:11.362
-Who is that?
-Dae-seok!

01:11.446 --> 01:13.865
-Stop it! Don't do it!
-What are you doing?

01:13.948 --> 01:14.824
Dangerous!

01:14.908 --> 01:17.410
-Stop messing around.
-Don't do this, man.

01:17.494 --> 01:19.412
-Come down.
-Calling the police?

01:19.496 --> 01:21.289
-Call them.
-Get down!

01:21.372 --> 01:24.542
As of today, the Daehan High outcast is…

01:24.626 --> 01:26.211
Drumroll, please!

01:27.545 --> 01:29.839
Park Dae-seok!

01:29.923 --> 01:32.300
-Congratulations!
-Congratulations!

01:32.383 --> 01:35.470
Let us now begin
the passing of the outcast stick ceremony.

01:35.553 --> 01:38.306
Former outcast Kim Gyeong-min,
please step forward.

01:38.389 --> 01:39.891
Stand up to receive it.

01:39.974 --> 01:41.810
Stand up, you fucking idiot.

01:41.893 --> 01:43.937
Now hand off the outcast stick!

01:47.023 --> 01:48.900
Hey, no phones allowed in class.

01:48.983 --> 01:50.652
…decreasing exponential function.

01:50.735 --> 01:52.445
I won't repeat myself.

01:52.529 --> 01:54.781
Man, I'm learning so much from this video.

01:55.281 --> 01:56.574
Try to be more like him.

01:58.660 --> 02:00.120
How dare you speak to me this way?

02:00.203 --> 02:02.122
You're just a substitute.
Not even a real teacher.

02:04.874 --> 02:07.460
If you want to be a real teacher,
my dad can help you.

02:07.544 --> 02:09.796
Oh, wouldn't you want that?

02:09.879 --> 02:11.422
So, if you're interested,

02:12.423 --> 02:14.259
shut the fuck up and leave me alone.

02:17.971 --> 02:19.681
How about you show some respect, dickhead?

02:19.764 --> 02:21.808
You're just some little boy
who always needs daddy.

02:24.686 --> 02:25.937
Oh, Dae-seok!

02:26.020 --> 02:28.565
So, Dae-seok, you wanna
stand up for her? All right!

02:28.648 --> 02:30.483
-Gwang-su, stop!
-What's the matter?

02:30.567 --> 02:32.735
You thought we'd just let you
get away with this?

02:32.819 --> 02:34.863
-Turn around.
-Someone help him!

02:34.946 --> 02:38.283
-You stupid son of a bitch.
-Why didn't he keep his mouth shut?

02:38.366 --> 02:40.076
Why are you all just watching?

02:45.582 --> 02:46.457
OUTCAST STICK

02:48.251 --> 02:51.171
We really hope
that you give it your all. All right!

02:51.254 --> 02:53.298
Now that the ceremony is finally over,

02:53.381 --> 02:55.717
everyone, let's give him
a round of applause!

02:58.720 --> 02:59.554
Dae-seok,

03:00.972 --> 03:03.683
You better start smiling,
or I'll smash your fuckin' head.

03:06.060 --> 03:07.020
Let's go for a walk.

03:07.896 --> 03:10.565
Why don't you join us, Gyeong-min?
Come on.

03:10.648 --> 03:11.941
I AM DUMB
TAKE A SWIPE AT ME

03:12.025 --> 03:13.401
Yeah!

03:14.569 --> 03:18.531
Everyone. As of today, this bitch
is the new outcast of Daehan High.

03:18.615 --> 03:19.991
Say hello.

03:21.826 --> 03:23.119
Hello, everyone.

03:23.620 --> 03:26.331
My name's Dae-seok
and I'll be your new school outcast.

03:26.831 --> 03:28.833
I'm happy to be here.

03:28.917 --> 03:31.002
Let's wish him a warm welcome! Whoo!

03:36.716 --> 03:38.509
Oh, Gyeong-min. What's wrong?

03:40.011 --> 03:41.346
Uh, nothing.

03:43.097 --> 03:45.975
How do you two
deal with the troublemakers in class?

03:46.059 --> 03:48.519
I pretty much gave up
trying to educate these brats.

03:48.603 --> 03:51.439
The only thing you can do
is deduct points on their final grades.

03:51.522 --> 03:52.690
It was over for us

03:52.774 --> 03:55.735
the moment they banned
corporal punishment in schools.

03:55.818 --> 03:58.905
Nowadays, the moment you try to instill
a bit of respect in the classroom,

03:58.988 --> 04:01.366
they try to get you
on some ridiculous child abuse charge.

04:01.449 --> 04:03.034
What do they want us to do?

04:03.993 --> 04:05.870
Then again, we can count ourselves lucky

04:05.954 --> 04:08.164
that we haven't been stabbed
by one of our students…

04:08.248 --> 04:10.250
Like the teacher two years ago.

04:10.333 --> 04:12.252
It was terrifying.

04:17.799 --> 04:19.425
Dae-seok, get down!

04:49.706 --> 04:50.832
The cops are here.

04:50.915 --> 04:53.167
-Where are they?
-Wait, actually?

04:53.251 --> 04:54.711
They must be here for Dae-seok.

04:54.794 --> 04:56.379
Those guys are fucked, right?

04:56.462 --> 04:58.256
Who's fucked now, motherfuckers?

04:58.339 --> 04:59.882
Say that again you dumb fuck.

04:59.966 --> 05:02.093
Quit staring and sit the fuck down!

05:14.814 --> 05:18.192
Let's welcome back our favorite outcast!

05:18.693 --> 05:20.028
Whoo-hoo!

05:20.111 --> 05:23.281
You really are the best
at this, aren't you?

05:23.364 --> 05:26.284
Look at you, you stupid fuck.
What's with that face?

05:26.909 --> 05:28.328
Did you think it was over?

05:28.411 --> 05:31.080
You thought the fucking police
would arrest us, we'd be thrown in jail

05:31.164 --> 05:33.708
and you could say,
“Wow, at least I can be free at school.”

05:33.791 --> 05:34.876
That what you were thinking?

05:34.959 --> 05:36.586
Huh?

05:36.669 --> 05:40.256
Oh, holy shit, you really don't get it,
you dumb fucking idiot.

05:40.757 --> 05:42.759
You all think it's over
for us now, don't you?

05:42.842 --> 05:44.260
Keep fucking dreaming.

05:45.136 --> 05:46.346
Nothing's changed.

05:46.929 --> 05:48.681
Please don't feel sad, all right?

05:48.765 --> 05:52.310
Let's all be glad that our little
Gyeong-min has taken back his role.

05:52.894 --> 05:54.812
By the way, have you had your first drink?

05:54.896 --> 05:57.148
Don't worry, as your dear friends,
we're gonna change that.

05:57.231 --> 06:01.736
-Oh, fuck yeah! Let's have fun!
-We want you to have a good time.

06:01.819 --> 06:04.489
You're only a man
once you've had your first drink.

06:04.572 --> 06:06.991
-Come on, sit still. Just one drink.
-Just don't move.

06:07.075 --> 06:08.201
-Oh!
-Take it!

06:08.284 --> 06:10.286
-Oh, whoa!
-There you go. Just stay there!

06:11.371 --> 06:13.039
There's alcohol everywhere!

06:18.002 --> 06:19.629
Everyone, quiet down!

06:58.584 --> 07:00.586
And he tried to block my shot.

07:00.670 --> 07:02.672
But I saw him coming,
and I just dished it out.

07:02.755 --> 07:04.924
Gyeong-min's here! Agh!

07:06.717 --> 07:09.470
Ah, all my training's made me too strong.
Sorry about that.

07:09.554 --> 07:12.181
It's… It's…

07:12.265 --> 07:15.017
Tuh, tuh, tuh, tuh. You stuttering
like a dumbass makes me feel worse.

07:15.101 --> 07:16.686
I'll stop, I'm sorry.

07:19.188 --> 07:21.482
No, come on, just hit me back. Hm?

07:21.566 --> 07:22.984
No, it's okay.

07:23.067 --> 07:25.778
This is for me. Otherwise, you're
gonna tell everyone I'm bullying you.

07:25.862 --> 07:27.530
-I won't.
-Just hit me, you fucking bitch.

07:27.613 --> 07:30.450
Hit me. I'm telling you to fucking hit me.
Do it! Goddamn it.

07:30.533 --> 07:32.243
Hey. Hey. Listen to me.

07:32.326 --> 07:36.414
Hey. How many times
do you want me to repeat myself?

07:36.497 --> 07:39.792
Come on. Look at me.
Go on, go for it. Just hit me.

07:40.877 --> 07:42.712
You motherfucker, lift your head up. Hey.

07:42.795 --> 07:45.381
Let me see.
I said let me see you, you bitch.

07:46.549 --> 07:49.469
Oh, for fuck's sake. You're all right.
Come on, you're fine.

07:49.552 --> 07:52.096
All right, get up. Here we go.
Let me teach you.

07:52.180 --> 07:55.224
When you hit someone,
you stare straight into their eyes, okay?

07:56.142 --> 07:57.435
Go.

08:02.190 --> 08:04.442
All right, that was good. One more time.

08:05.651 --> 08:08.654
Are you fucking serious?
Come on, don't cry.

08:08.738 --> 08:10.281
All right, fine, I'll close my eyes.

08:10.781 --> 08:13.743
Do it. Hit me. This is your chance.

08:13.826 --> 08:16.078
Just hit me! Come on, man up!

08:16.162 --> 08:18.789
Oh, come on, you bitch. Do it, do it--

08:24.962 --> 08:27.089
Goddamn. What the fuck?

08:27.590 --> 08:28.883
Oh, okay, okay.

08:30.384 --> 08:32.470
-Who is that?
-Did he just hit him?

08:33.137 --> 08:34.263
Here we go.

08:43.689 --> 08:44.899
Are you the one that hit me?

08:47.276 --> 08:48.819
Who the fuck are you?

08:49.403 --> 08:50.279
Are you a teacher?

08:50.363 --> 08:51.989
You really need to watch your mouth!

09:01.165 --> 09:03.042
All right.

09:03.626 --> 09:04.710
Oh.

09:05.253 --> 09:06.254
Okay.

09:09.632 --> 09:10.591
Fuck you!

09:20.184 --> 09:22.603
Oh shit. Stop fucking filming!

09:25.064 --> 09:28.568
-You…
-It is prohibited to run in the halls.

09:28.651 --> 09:29.527
Fucker!

09:42.790 --> 09:45.251
Shh!

09:56.220 --> 09:59.890
On school grounds, engaging
in disorderly conduct is forbidden.

10:05.104 --> 10:08.316
-Look, it's Jun-hyeong.
-He's here. What's he gonna do?

10:08.399 --> 10:10.610
That guy's finished now. He's dead.

10:13.446 --> 10:15.865
So, who are you?

10:15.948 --> 10:18.242
I've just been assigned
to the school today.

10:18.326 --> 10:19.952
Oh, so you're new?

10:20.911 --> 10:22.788
Teachers shouldn't put
their hands on students.

10:22.872 --> 10:24.624
-Hey, record this.
-Okay.

10:24.707 --> 10:26.375
Everyone, pull out your phones.

10:26.459 --> 10:28.461
Hey, pull out your phone.

10:34.342 --> 10:38.179
What's wrong? You scared of the cameras?
Go on. Hit me now, old man.

10:38.679 --> 10:41.349
All right. I get it.

10:41.849 --> 10:44.727
Here. Come on, stand up.

10:47.521 --> 10:48.856
Is he crazy?

10:50.232 --> 10:51.651
No? No? No!

10:51.734 --> 10:53.361
Well, if you insist.

10:53.444 --> 10:55.363
He hit him again!

10:58.616 --> 11:00.451
How about we make a cool Short of you?

11:00.534 --> 11:02.119
TEACHING A LESSON
STUDENT ASSAULT

11:02.203 --> 11:03.120
THE GRIM REAPER

11:03.204 --> 11:05.039
WHACK! YET TO START
THRILLING! SPICY!

11:05.122 --> 11:06.874
How about another one?

11:06.957 --> 11:07.792
SLAP

11:07.875 --> 11:09.919
WHO'S THE ABUSIVE TEACHER?
SLAPPING ARTIST

11:10.711 --> 11:12.171
SMILE OR GET F***ED

11:12.254 --> 11:13.881
Say hi, everyone.

11:14.548 --> 11:15.383
Cheese.

11:15.466 --> 11:17.718
What's going on? Get out of the way!

11:18.386 --> 11:19.804
-Watch it.
-Who are you?

11:20.304 --> 11:21.972
Hey, hey. Hey, hey. What happened?

11:22.473 --> 11:24.308
How dare you hurt this child?
Give me your name!

11:24.392 --> 11:26.102
Right, you don't know who I am. Hm.

11:26.185 --> 11:28.145
He says that
he's a newly-appointed teacher.

11:28.229 --> 11:30.898
A new teacher?
Well, this is the first I've heard of it.

11:30.981 --> 11:32.733
Mister, you better tell me your name.

11:32.817 --> 11:34.360
Right, um, my name…

11:37.947 --> 11:39.031
One moment, yeah.

11:42.243 --> 11:44.286
Korean Educational Rights Protection
Bureau inspector.

11:44.370 --> 11:45.246
INSPECTOR NA HWA-JIN

11:45.329 --> 11:46.455
The Bureau!

11:47.790 --> 11:49.291
Na Hwa-jin is my name.

11:49.375 --> 11:51.627
Educational Rights Protection Bureau?

11:52.128 --> 11:54.797
-Have you ever heard of this thing?
-I've never heard of it.

11:54.880 --> 11:57.883
Well, that's understandable.
We've only just created it.

11:57.967 --> 11:59.802
And what does this Protection Bureau mean?

11:59.885 --> 12:02.722
Oh, this is exciting.
I get to explain it for the first time.

12:04.890 --> 12:07.852
We offer specialized educational support
to certain problematic institutions

12:07.935 --> 12:11.147
who resort to bribing the police
to cover up certain issues.

12:11.230 --> 12:13.399
Such as the death
of one of their students.

12:13.482 --> 12:14.942
First, that never happened.

12:15.025 --> 12:18.487
But the real issue
is you putting hands on him.

12:18.571 --> 12:19.780
That's where you're wrong.

12:20.406 --> 12:23.200
You should know that members of
the Educational Rights Protection Bureau

12:23.284 --> 12:24.702
have special dispensation.

12:24.785 --> 12:26.829
We can do whatever we want. Yeah.

12:27.329 --> 12:29.290
Our approach depends on the students.

12:29.874 --> 12:32.960
All well-behaved students
will be praised by the Bureau.

12:33.544 --> 12:36.922
The other students, who misbehave
and lack respect, will be beaten.

12:38.466 --> 12:39.759
So as of today,

12:39.842 --> 12:43.554
the Educational Rights Protection Bureau
will be in charge of this school.

12:45.890 --> 12:48.350
Looking forward to teaching you a lesson.

12:55.941 --> 12:59.570
TEACH YOU A LESSON

12:59.653 --> 13:01.322
MINISTRY OF EDUCATION
ATTN: SCHOOL PRINCIPAL

13:01.405 --> 13:05.493
Wow! Well, I guess
the Bureau really does exist.

13:06.577 --> 13:09.163
But I assure you,
there are no issues in our school.

13:09.246 --> 13:11.791
Listen, there are no bullies here.

13:11.874 --> 13:14.919
The kind of behavior you're talking about
is simply inconceivable here.

13:15.002 --> 13:17.546
All the students
come from high-class backgrounds.

13:17.630 --> 13:20.341
Many of the pupils are from famous
political and business families.

13:20.424 --> 13:22.259
We even have the son
of a member of parliament.

13:22.343 --> 13:24.720
Park Dae-seok was a student in class 5.

13:24.804 --> 13:27.014
I'll be the homeroom teacher in that class
from now on.

13:27.097 --> 13:28.682
Parents won't agree to this.

13:28.766 --> 13:31.602
They don't appreciate it
when there are sudden unexpected changes.

13:31.685 --> 13:32.853
If the students' grades drop,

13:32.937 --> 13:35.397
the backlash against the school
would be terrible.

13:35.898 --> 13:38.734
Is that what you're afraid of?

13:39.860 --> 13:41.529
Their grades?

13:42.196 --> 13:45.407
Well, you see, one of the students
is the son of a famous congressman.

13:45.491 --> 13:46.742
I'm sure you've heard of him.

13:46.826 --> 13:48.953
Ryu Gwang-pil, the next candidate
for the president?

13:49.036 --> 13:51.205
He could change your life.

13:52.289 --> 13:55.000
You and I wouldn't gain anything
from getting on his bad side.

13:57.211 --> 13:59.213
Now, what you said is very scary indeed.

13:59.296 --> 14:02.174
Well, of course, who wouldn't be scared
of such a powerful man?

14:02.258 --> 14:06.303
Principal Kim, a world
where adults are afraid of children…

14:08.389 --> 14:10.516
is a world that is nearing its end.

14:12.393 --> 14:16.689
Man, my ears won't stop
fucking ringing. Oh my God!

14:16.772 --> 14:19.066
Hey. That Protection Bureau
doesn't seem to exist.

14:19.149 --> 14:21.777
Even if it does,
he won't do a fucking thing to me.

14:21.861 --> 14:24.864
Yeah, you're right.
Your dad owns all of them anyways.

14:32.788 --> 14:34.123
Hi.

14:34.206 --> 14:37.084
I believe you remember me from
this morning. No need for an introduction.

14:37.167 --> 14:38.794
I'll be your teacher from now on.

14:38.878 --> 14:41.088
-Oh shit.
-Oh, we're so fucked, man.

14:41.171 --> 14:42.840
Look at that. What a warm welcome.

14:42.923 --> 14:44.675
Let's take attendance.

14:44.758 --> 14:45.676
Ko Gyeong-chan.

14:45.759 --> 14:47.261
-Here.
-Kim Gyeong-min.

14:47.344 --> 14:48.345
Present.

14:50.264 --> 14:52.516
-Kim Gwang-su.
-Right here.

14:54.101 --> 14:56.270
Oh, Gwang-su?

14:56.979 --> 14:58.731
-Kim Na-rae.
-Present.

14:58.814 --> 14:59.982
Ryu Jun-hyeong.

15:06.447 --> 15:07.323
Park Dae-seok.

15:12.828 --> 15:13.996
Oh yeah. That's right.

15:14.079 --> 15:15.581
Dae-seok is dead.

15:16.665 --> 15:19.627
Does anyone know why he committed suicide?

15:19.710 --> 15:22.421
I heard that Dae-seok killed himself
over his grades.

15:22.504 --> 15:24.548
Oh! You think so?

15:25.758 --> 15:28.010
Well, I heard that some of you

15:29.053 --> 15:31.138
relentlessly bullied Dae-seok.

15:31.847 --> 15:33.390
You bullied him so much

15:34.934 --> 15:37.436
that he couldn't take it anymore
and died by suicide.

15:37.519 --> 15:39.647
Oh no, not at all.

15:39.730 --> 15:42.691
He was just an idiot that thought
the solution to his problems was to…

15:44.360 --> 15:46.028
…and then all his issues
would be over with.

15:46.111 --> 15:47.947
Jesus, you really love to run your mouth.

15:48.030 --> 15:51.909
-So, how about I teach you some manners?
-Please wait.

15:52.493 --> 15:53.744
Mm?

15:53.827 --> 15:55.579
Ooh!

15:58.666 --> 16:00.459
You guys really are unbelievable.

16:00.542 --> 16:03.587
All you bums gathered together
in one class.

16:03.671 --> 16:06.590
You believe teachers
are the scum of the earth.

16:06.674 --> 16:09.051
And you proudly continue
the tradition of bullying.

16:09.134 --> 16:10.427
You fucking bastard!

16:14.348 --> 16:15.891
One of your classmates commits suicide,

16:15.975 --> 16:18.811
and here you sit
acting as though nothing happened.

16:18.894 --> 16:22.231
You guys really are something else. Damn.

16:23.816 --> 16:24.984
All those guilty faces.

16:26.193 --> 16:28.737
But you know, class,
guilt shouldn't just be a thought.

16:28.821 --> 16:30.364
It should be felt.

16:31.281 --> 16:33.701
All of you, plank position right now.

16:34.576 --> 16:36.036
I'm only gonna count to three.

16:36.870 --> 16:37.871
Three!

16:41.834 --> 16:43.085
Sit down.

16:46.755 --> 16:47.756
I said sit down!

16:55.597 --> 16:57.307
We begin our practice exams soon.

16:57.391 --> 16:58.767
So let's just focus on that.

16:58.851 --> 17:01.437
In the end,
isn't it your job to get us good grades?

17:01.520 --> 17:03.313
I'm certain that I said three.

17:05.858 --> 17:08.819
Look at that. These fuckers
seem to fear me more than you.

17:08.902 --> 17:10.821
Well, I'm so glad you said that.

17:11.613 --> 17:15.659
That means, if you're scared of me,
they'll all follow suit, right?

17:16.160 --> 17:18.370
The problem is that you don't scare me.

17:20.497 --> 17:22.332
There's nothing you can do.

17:24.293 --> 17:27.546
Don't worry about it.
I'm sure I'll come up with something.

17:34.428 --> 17:35.345
Oh my God!

17:39.266 --> 17:40.768
Agh, let go of me!

17:44.938 --> 17:47.274
Do you have any idea who I am?

17:47.357 --> 17:49.359
Of course. You're a student.

17:49.443 --> 17:50.569
And nothing more.

17:52.738 --> 17:54.740
I will make sure every single day

17:56.283 --> 17:57.576
feels like a living hell.

18:06.460 --> 18:08.462
All right. Three!

18:15.302 --> 18:16.595
For the last time.

18:19.181 --> 18:20.015
Three.

18:36.990 --> 18:39.326
100 GLORIOUS YEARS OF DAEHAN
MAY IT THRIVE FOREVER

18:39.409 --> 18:41.954
-Thank you.
-My pleasure. Want some more?

18:42.037 --> 18:44.456
-Thank you very much.
-Of course. Enjoy your meal.

18:44.540 --> 18:46.875
-How are you today?
-Ah!

18:46.959 --> 18:49.419
-All right, let's go.
-Oh!

18:49.503 --> 18:51.547
-Get the fuck out of my way.
-Just for you.

18:52.422 --> 18:54.591
-Please enjoy your meal.
-Thanks.

18:55.175 --> 18:56.593
Thank you very much.

19:01.515 --> 19:03.934
Seriously, aren't you ashamed
of being such an asshole?

19:04.017 --> 19:05.102
Huh?

19:05.185 --> 19:06.812
Stop acting like such dicks.

19:08.522 --> 19:09.898
This fucking guy.

19:09.982 --> 19:11.441
Go to the back of the line.

19:11.525 --> 19:12.901
I don't see anyone complaining.

19:15.737 --> 19:19.950
Man, power really is a scary thing,
isn't it? Look at them.

19:21.660 --> 19:23.662
No student should have this influence.

19:23.745 --> 19:26.623
If you want to eat lunch today,
go back to the end of the line.

19:27.291 --> 19:28.292
Otherwise, just get out.

19:33.297 --> 19:34.590
Ugh.

19:35.257 --> 19:37.009
Oh no. What's he doing?

19:46.185 --> 19:48.103
You ungrateful bastard.

19:49.104 --> 19:53.066
Oh, sorry about that. It annoys me
when people waste their food. Huh?

19:53.567 --> 19:56.737
What are we gonna do about this?
Your clothes are all dirty.

19:56.820 --> 19:59.281
I know that your father's
a rich congressman and all that,

19:59.364 --> 20:01.825
but you should still take better care
of your clothes, right?

20:01.909 --> 20:02.826
Let me get that.

20:02.910 --> 20:05.329
Oh, man, see, this is why
you shouldn't play with food.

20:05.412 --> 20:07.164
You've got sauce all over you.

20:07.664 --> 20:09.583
Hold on, if we put this on your head…

20:09.666 --> 20:12.586
Oh, my, Jun-hyeong!
Look at how pretty you look.

20:13.086 --> 20:15.005
Hey, why don't you take pictures
of all this?

20:15.088 --> 20:17.674
I'm sure this would make
a great Short. Right?

20:17.758 --> 20:19.718
Let's all learn from our kind Jun-hyeong

20:19.801 --> 20:21.637
and enjoy the lovely meals
being served today.

20:21.720 --> 20:22.846
Okay?

20:22.930 --> 20:25.265
Now, since you made this mess,
you clean it up.

20:26.099 --> 20:27.434
Everyone else in line!

20:27.517 --> 20:28.644
Chow time!

20:41.448 --> 20:42.908
You must be so excited.

20:44.076 --> 20:45.285
Not at all.

20:46.286 --> 20:47.162
What did you say?

20:50.874 --> 20:52.918
What the fuck did you say?

20:54.002 --> 20:55.712
Huh?

20:56.255 --> 20:57.589
You fucking piece of shit.

20:58.465 --> 20:59.299
You're right.

21:00.509 --> 21:02.427
Sorry.

21:10.310 --> 21:12.479
Fucking loser.

21:20.529 --> 21:21.488
Sweetheart?

21:22.572 --> 21:23.907
Where'd she go?

21:28.537 --> 21:29.663
Can I help you, sir?

21:29.746 --> 21:31.540
Hey, sorry, is this the residence

21:31.623 --> 21:34.209
of the great and powerful
Congressman Ryu Gwang-pil?

21:36.128 --> 21:38.922
Look at that. These are real fruits.

21:39.006 --> 21:41.425
They're not just decoration
you have laying around.

21:41.925 --> 21:46.930
It's a long time since I've had one.
I forgot what they might taste like. Mm?

21:47.431 --> 21:48.724
Mmm.

21:48.807 --> 21:50.600
Oh, these are really delicious.

21:55.355 --> 21:56.398
Jun-hyeong.

21:57.524 --> 22:01.862
Now that my son is here, would you please
share the reason for your visit tonight?

22:01.945 --> 22:02.946
Sure.

22:04.740 --> 22:08.327
Well, little Jun-hyeong here left early
and didn't clean up after class.

22:09.786 --> 22:11.788
“Students stand as one,

22:11.872 --> 22:14.041
and the teacher stands above all.”

22:14.124 --> 22:15.375
Didn't I tell you that, kid?

22:16.376 --> 22:18.503
The issue is
he's gotten away with this before.

22:18.587 --> 22:20.756
Apparently, he's not afraid of anyone.

22:23.383 --> 22:26.219
During your last campaign,
you ran with the slogan,

22:26.303 --> 22:29.306
“People as people, politics as politics.”

22:29.389 --> 22:30.390
Isn't that right?

22:30.974 --> 22:32.517
You see, I agree with that.

22:32.601 --> 22:34.561
Teachers should behave like teachers.

22:35.562 --> 22:38.857
And the same thing
goes for students, damn punk!

22:41.443 --> 22:44.237
And so now I'll be taking your son
to clean things up.

22:44.321 --> 22:45.405
Like I told him to.

22:45.489 --> 22:48.450
He's been targeting me, Dad.

22:48.533 --> 22:50.744
He's trying to blame me
for what happened to Dae-seok!

22:55.582 --> 22:56.416
Hm.

22:57.417 --> 22:58.585
Thank you. That was good.

22:59.628 --> 23:01.797
All righty, then.
I'll be taking him with me.

23:01.880 --> 23:03.924
I'll make sure
he learns his lesson. Let's go.

23:05.300 --> 23:06.885
I believe you're making a mistake.

23:06.968 --> 23:09.346
Yes, mistakes were made
in your son's education.

23:09.429 --> 23:11.598
-I'll correct them.
-Doors closing.

23:11.681 --> 23:14.267
Damn it. Why didn't you
press the button, you punk?

23:15.727 --> 23:17.979
Thank you. Goodbye. Till next time.

23:18.063 --> 23:19.606
-Let go!
-Where's the entrance?

23:19.689 --> 23:21.983
-Doors closing.
-These doors are slow.

23:28.824 --> 23:31.159
Would you look
at how clean the whole bathroom is.

23:31.243 --> 23:33.036
You did a very nice job.

23:33.870 --> 23:35.622
I can see my reflection down there.

23:36.540 --> 23:38.625
You're good when you want to be. Okay.

23:38.708 --> 23:41.711
Once you're done here, leave the cleaning
supplies just like you found them.

23:41.795 --> 23:43.880
All right?

23:55.267 --> 23:57.269
STUDENT RECORD

23:57.352 --> 24:01.565
STUDENT NAME: PARK DAE-SEOK

24:06.820 --> 24:08.405
Choi Gang-seok.

24:10.824 --> 24:13.076
I've just learned
that the Minister of Education

24:13.160 --> 24:14.995
is the founder of the ERPB.

24:15.078 --> 24:17.247
I've also learned
that you are not a licensed teacher.

24:17.330 --> 24:20.584
I have been given the title of teacher
until the end of our inquiry.

24:20.667 --> 24:22.252
But I'm sure you already knew that.

24:23.211 --> 24:25.505
There is something
I need your help clarifying.

24:25.589 --> 24:27.257
How did my Jun-hyeong bruise his head?

24:28.175 --> 24:29.551
I'm not sure what to say.

24:29.634 --> 24:32.554
I told him to clean the bowl,
but I never said to smash his head on it.

24:32.637 --> 24:35.891
Are you saying he deliberately inflicted
an injury on himself just to frame you?

24:35.974 --> 24:37.726
I know he finds it's easy to hurt others,

24:37.809 --> 24:40.103
but can you imagine
how terrified he was of hurting himself?

24:40.187 --> 24:41.646
And that bruise of his,

24:41.730 --> 24:43.273
doesn't it look a little staged?

24:52.908 --> 24:54.409
Seems you're the one who's not afraid.

24:54.493 --> 24:57.120
Let's imagine a doctor
who's afraid of their patients.

24:57.204 --> 24:58.663
He'd be unable to treat them.

24:59.706 --> 25:02.083
Now if you imagine a lawyer
who's afraid of their clients,

25:02.167 --> 25:03.627
he couldn't represent them, could he?

25:04.961 --> 25:08.089
And lastly, if a teacher
were afraid of their students,

25:08.882 --> 25:10.926
would they be able to teach them properly?

25:11.009 --> 25:12.135
Oh.

25:13.678 --> 25:15.680
I'm sure you're well aware

25:16.723 --> 25:18.725
of what it means
that I'm standing here today.

25:22.062 --> 25:24.981
The ERPB is a national organization.

25:26.107 --> 25:27.901
You'd be picking a pretty big fight.

25:27.984 --> 25:31.196
-That's my field of expertise.
-That's good to know.

25:52.300 --> 25:55.095
We heard that you reported us
to the Bureau, you fucking bitch.

25:56.012 --> 25:58.098
-It wasn't me.
-Don't fucking lie to us.

25:58.181 --> 26:01.142
You know how busy Jun-hyeong's father is?
You made him come all the way here.

26:01.226 --> 26:04.396
-You wanna meet Dae-seok that bad?
-I swear it wasn't me. I didn't call 'em.

26:05.313 --> 26:07.440
-You motherfucker.
-Hey, hey, hey.

26:07.524 --> 26:09.025
It wasn't you?

26:09.109 --> 26:12.279
I don't fucking care if you
were the one who called. You're gonna pay.

26:13.321 --> 26:15.574
What did we do to you, huh?
You little punk.

26:15.657 --> 26:16.658
Let's leave.

26:16.741 --> 26:17.826
Keep moving.

26:17.909 --> 26:20.579
-I said keep moving.
-You stupid fuck.

26:20.662 --> 26:23.540
Hey, lift your head, fucker.

26:26.167 --> 26:29.004
Hey, hey. Come on, admit you called them.

26:54.446 --> 26:56.740
Jeez, kid, you're a real handful,
aren't you?

26:56.823 --> 26:58.158
So, what do you want? Up or down?

26:58.241 --> 27:00.160
Up! Just pull me up!

27:00.243 --> 27:01.870
Hey, don't forget the magic word now.

27:01.953 --> 27:05.081
Please pull me up!

27:17.302 --> 27:18.720
Come with me.

27:25.477 --> 27:27.854
So it seems like
you're always getting beat up

27:27.937 --> 27:30.273
by Ryu Jun-hyeong and his boys.
Is that it?

27:33.193 --> 27:36.404
So, how long do you plan
on getting bullied and doing nothing, kid?

27:38.406 --> 27:40.659
Don't lecture me.
You don't know what you're talking about.

27:41.368 --> 27:45.330
You know what changes if I fight back?
Nothing. They'll just do it again.

27:45.413 --> 27:47.123
When did I tell you to fight back?

27:47.999 --> 27:49.084
I'm just telling you to run.

27:50.377 --> 27:52.128
Listen, if anyone tells you to fight back,

27:52.212 --> 27:54.839
then clearly they've never been beat up
by a group of guys before.

27:56.216 --> 27:57.509
Then they'd beat me again.

27:57.592 --> 27:58.885
Then you just run away again.

27:58.968 --> 28:00.845
I can't just run forever.

28:01.346 --> 28:04.015
That's true.
You can't just keep running away.

28:04.099 --> 28:05.266
So, then,

28:06.184 --> 28:07.602
go and speak with an adult.

28:08.228 --> 28:09.646
And what good will that do?

28:09.729 --> 28:12.399
You'll never know until you ask.

28:14.234 --> 28:15.902
There are good adults out there.

28:20.699 --> 28:22.325
So, Gyeong-min, from now on,

28:22.826 --> 28:25.954
you are going to learn
to run as fast as possible.

28:26.621 --> 28:28.123
See that soccer goal over there?

28:28.623 --> 28:30.583
You've got ten seconds to make it back.

28:31.501 --> 28:33.044
-Sir?
-Run.

28:33.128 --> 28:35.463
Are you deaf? Run!

28:35.547 --> 28:38.258
Come on, faster than that!
This the fastest you can run?

28:38.758 --> 28:40.468
Keep slacking
and I'll set the dogs on you.

28:40.552 --> 28:43.388
-There's a dog here?
-Yeah, me! I'm the wild dog.

28:44.097 --> 28:45.432
-Hurry up, kid!
-Okay!

28:48.518 --> 28:50.520
Gyeong-min, think you can manage
on your own?

28:50.603 --> 28:53.440
-Yes, sir.
-Damn right. You got it.

28:54.399 --> 28:56.818
You did a good job today.
Thank you very much.

28:57.902 --> 28:59.904
Look at that presentation.

28:59.988 --> 29:02.532
I think you might've learned
a thing or two from being bullied.

29:03.658 --> 29:05.243
So you're just like them, sir.

29:05.326 --> 29:06.828
That's where you'd be wrong.

29:06.911 --> 29:09.748
They're just bullies.
I'm a teacher who cares.

29:12.000 --> 29:13.585
They're not just bullies though.

29:14.335 --> 29:16.296
They've got power and influence.

29:17.922 --> 29:19.674
Do you know Jun-hyeong's father?

29:19.758 --> 29:21.676
He can ruin an entire family just for fun.

29:21.760 --> 29:23.803
Don't worry about his father, all right?

29:24.804 --> 29:26.389
I've got my own powerful allies.

29:27.724 --> 29:29.684
I'm glad you have people to rely on.

29:31.978 --> 29:32.937
Gyeong-min,

29:33.980 --> 29:36.024
you know, you also have
people you can rely on.

29:37.734 --> 29:38.735
Like who?

29:41.571 --> 29:42.614
What do you mean?

29:43.698 --> 29:45.450
So, no one comes to mind?

29:46.701 --> 29:48.536
Come on, kid. Think a bit.

29:53.500 --> 29:56.503
Jeez, you're a student.
There's only one answer. Teachers.

29:57.295 --> 29:59.380
Are you kidding me?
Weren't you listening earlier?

29:59.881 --> 30:01.424
Look, I can be pretty reliable.

30:02.091 --> 30:04.803
-I peeled this just for you.
-Oh, thank you, sir.

30:10.683 --> 30:13.520
So, Gyeong-min, you're telling me
you went through all of high school

30:13.603 --> 30:15.480
without making a friend, huh?

30:18.358 --> 30:20.235
I haven't always been the outcast.

30:23.947 --> 30:25.782
How come you didn't tell your parents?

30:26.324 --> 30:28.076
Were you worried about how they'd react?

30:37.043 --> 30:43.967
DARLING SON
ENJOY YOUR DAY!

30:48.638 --> 30:50.181
Huh, who knows?

30:50.765 --> 30:53.226
Just eat your ramyeon while it's warm.

30:59.232 --> 31:00.233
All right.

31:13.746 --> 31:17.041
MINISTRY OF EDUCATION

31:19.210 --> 31:21.796
Oh, uh, sir, you can't go in there!

31:24.841 --> 31:28.678
Oh. To what do I owe
this pleasure, Congressman Ryu?

31:28.761 --> 31:31.264
This Protection Bureau thing,

31:31.347 --> 31:33.016
is it true you're the one behind all this?

31:38.104 --> 31:40.148
Well, yes, I am.

31:40.732 --> 31:41.983
How about a cup of tea?

31:42.483 --> 31:44.485
I didn't come here to drink tea with you.

31:46.946 --> 31:49.449
Why don't you come and sit down?

31:52.368 --> 31:54.829
Minister, why did you feel the need
to create this thing?

31:56.414 --> 31:59.208
I did it because I had to.

32:00.209 --> 32:02.128
I'm sure I don't have to remind you

32:02.754 --> 32:05.840
of the teacher
who was murdered two years ago.

32:05.924 --> 32:08.343
That teacher was killed by her student.

32:09.052 --> 32:11.638
The reason I created
the Education Rights Protection Bureau

32:11.721 --> 32:14.057
was to ensure that such a tragedy
never happened again.

32:14.140 --> 32:16.017
But why send them to Daehan High School?

32:16.100 --> 32:19.270
My son is now being harassed
by one of your inspectors.

32:19.354 --> 32:21.606
Are you telling me
your son attends Daehan High School?

32:23.316 --> 32:25.568
Why, I wasn't aware.

32:26.069 --> 32:29.030
Do you know what your so-called inspector
has been doing at the school?

32:29.113 --> 32:31.032
If it went public, we'd all be in trouble.

32:31.115 --> 32:34.243
Nothing good can come of this, so let's
end this quietly while we still can.

32:37.121 --> 32:40.375
You see, it's just
that we've only just started,

32:40.458 --> 32:43.294
and founding this organization
was no easy task.

32:43.378 --> 32:45.296
How about we give it a chance first?

32:45.380 --> 32:48.424
Minister Gang-seok, you know
how much I respect you, don't you?

32:49.550 --> 32:51.803
I'm saying this
with all the care in the world.

32:51.886 --> 32:55.431
It'd be a terrible shame for you to retire
over something so mundane.

33:01.562 --> 33:03.398
A father helping his son

33:04.190 --> 33:05.817
must never be taken lightly.

33:16.995 --> 33:20.248
Welcome to Congressman
Ryu Gwang-pil's Happy Hope Party.

33:20.331 --> 33:22.875
-Thank you for your support.
-Thank you for your support.

33:22.959 --> 33:24.877
-What time is it?
-Take a book.

33:24.961 --> 33:28.131
-Till next time.
-How about a bit of professionalism?

33:28.214 --> 33:29.090
Sorry about that.

33:29.173 --> 33:31.509
“People as people, politics as politics”

33:31.592 --> 33:32.885
What's this?

33:32.969 --> 33:35.054
“Using aides for personal matters?”

33:35.138 --> 33:37.932
Bribes of valuables
in exchange for local election nomination?

33:38.016 --> 33:39.475
Sexual harassment?

33:39.559 --> 33:42.729
Ryu Gwang-pil!
Ryu Gwang-pil! Ryu Gwang-pil!

33:42.812 --> 33:44.731
Thank you. So glad you could make it.

33:44.814 --> 33:47.775
-You've got my vote.
-I know you're busy. Thank you for coming.

33:47.859 --> 33:50.570
What do you have to say
about the allegations of bribery?

33:50.653 --> 33:51.988
An anonymous tip was just released

33:52.071 --> 33:54.282
regarding your sexual harassment
of female colleagues.

33:54.365 --> 33:57.618
Information has been released
on your use of government property.

33:57.702 --> 33:59.871
What the hell is going on right now?

34:00.955 --> 34:02.415
Congressman Gwang-pil!

34:02.498 --> 34:04.542
What does this mean for your campaign?

34:05.126 --> 34:06.878
-Stay back! Stay back!
-Congressman Gwang-pil!

34:09.338 --> 34:10.965
Goddamn it.

34:13.426 --> 34:14.844
What the hell's going on?

34:48.419 --> 34:51.172
Is everything all right?
What's all the commotion?

34:51.255 --> 34:52.840
Don't worry. It's nothing.

34:53.549 --> 34:55.551
Now if you'll excuse me, I have to go.

34:57.303 --> 35:01.349
Our dear Congressman Ryu
doesn't seem to fully grasp his situation.

35:11.859 --> 35:13.069
Wait a minute.

35:14.320 --> 35:16.489
Are you the one who leaked all of this?

35:16.572 --> 35:18.783
Why the hell are you doing this to me?!

35:27.792 --> 35:29.836
Did you know it took me two years

35:31.420 --> 35:33.172
to establish the Bureau.

35:34.423 --> 35:38.386
And it turns out
that you can learn a lot in two years.

35:49.105 --> 35:51.607
RYU GWANG-PIL
UNOFFICIAL REPORT

35:53.359 --> 35:54.861
RECORDING OF VICTIM INTERVIEW

35:59.115 --> 36:01.075
RYU GWANG-PIL
NOMINATION CORRUPTION REPORT

36:05.163 --> 36:08.833
Are you insane? By doing this to me,
you will ruin our party!

36:09.333 --> 36:11.544
We are both on the same side!

36:12.044 --> 36:13.379
That's where you're wrong.

36:13.880 --> 36:17.300
There are no sides
when we talk about education.

36:17.383 --> 36:19.844
I knew it.
You were targeting me from the start.

36:19.927 --> 36:21.053
What did I do wrong?

36:21.137 --> 36:23.514
I did more for this party
than anyone else did!

36:23.598 --> 36:25.516
You still think this is about the party?

36:26.142 --> 36:28.936
As for what you did wrong,
well, I'm sure it'll be all over the news.

36:31.647 --> 36:33.733
This isn't fucking fair!

36:33.816 --> 36:36.527
I've done nothing
compared to the rest of these scum,

36:36.611 --> 36:39.030
so why would you ever do this to me?

36:47.205 --> 36:49.332
Because you needed to fall

36:50.458 --> 36:51.667
for your son

36:53.127 --> 36:54.754
to learn his lesson.

37:00.384 --> 37:05.181
Really, you should have done a better job
at raising that child of yours.

37:17.026 --> 37:18.653
Minister. Everyone, make room.

37:21.614 --> 37:22.990
Goddamn it!

37:23.491 --> 37:26.202
That's him, isn't it?

37:26.786 --> 37:30.539
The National Assembly
approved a motion to arrest Ryu Gwang-pil,

37:30.623 --> 37:34.669
who is under investigation in connection
to multiple corruption allegations.

37:34.752 --> 37:36.963
Support for the motion increased
amid reports

37:37.046 --> 37:39.799
alleging that the congressman's son
was a notorious bully

37:39.882 --> 37:42.426
whose actions drove one of his victims
to take his own life.

37:42.510 --> 37:44.220
This case, which had nearly been buried,

37:44.303 --> 37:48.349
was uncovered by an investigation by
the Educational Rights Protection Bureau,

37:48.432 --> 37:49.725
a newly established agency

37:49.809 --> 37:51.936
under the direct authority
of the Minister of Education.

37:52.019 --> 37:55.314
The Bureau operates independently
and is responsible for receiving reports,

37:55.398 --> 37:58.234
conducting investigations
and responding to violation of conduct.

38:00.987 --> 38:03.489
I'm starting to think
this will become a political issue.

38:04.240 --> 38:05.283
Will that be a problem?

38:05.366 --> 38:08.286
Don't you worry about that.
I'll make sure to bite the bullet.

38:08.869 --> 38:10.997
You just focus on getting the job done.

38:12.999 --> 38:15.459
What are you talking about,
"I'll bite the bullet"?

38:16.127 --> 38:18.671
Get back to me
once you've been in the line of fire.

38:19.964 --> 38:21.674
It was only a metaphor.

38:23.259 --> 38:24.635
You think I'm in the line of fire?

38:24.719 --> 38:26.387
No, I was just using a metaphor.

38:26.470 --> 38:27.763
Great job today.

38:39.817 --> 38:42.028
Hey, hey, hey. Did you guys see this?

38:42.111 --> 38:44.780
As of today, the Daehan High outcast is

38:44.864 --> 38:48.576
our adorable princess Jun-hyeong!
Congratulations!

38:48.659 --> 38:51.620
-I really think this fits you best.
-I think you're right.

38:51.704 --> 38:53.456
Oh! Oh!

38:54.540 --> 38:57.209
Oh, sweetheart, where are you going? Huh?

38:57.293 --> 38:59.712
Don't forget you're fucking nothing
without your dad!

38:59.795 --> 39:01.422
Looks like the dumpster boy's back.

39:02.798 --> 39:05.926
OUTCAST STICK`

39:52.431 --> 39:54.016
It wasn't your fault.

40:02.942 --> 40:04.068
Gyeong-min.

40:06.570 --> 40:07.947
It wasn't your fault.

40:17.456 --> 40:19.834
When Dae-seok was picked as the outcast,

40:21.127 --> 40:22.920
I'm ashamed to say it felt good.

40:24.213 --> 40:25.506
Then, when he died,

40:26.549 --> 40:28.342
the first thing I did was smile.

40:30.845 --> 40:34.515
For once, I thought that I was finally
going to be able to escape this place.

40:38.686 --> 40:42.481
In the end, I'm just the same
as all of them.

40:44.358 --> 40:46.068
You're nothing like them, kid.

40:47.611 --> 40:49.989
You were an innocent victim
that was abandoned.

40:50.573 --> 40:52.825
Abandoned by the adults
that were around you

40:53.451 --> 40:55.161
as they stood by
and watched you in silence

40:55.244 --> 40:57.329
as the bullies
made your life a living hell.

40:57.830 --> 41:00.332
So don't you ever believe that you

41:00.833 --> 41:02.293
are anything like them.

41:33.240 --> 41:34.700
Get out of the way!

41:35.534 --> 41:37.328
You all still think it's funny?

41:37.411 --> 41:39.330
-Stop! You're insane!
-You motherfuckers!

41:39.413 --> 41:41.332
Asshole, I just filmed you doing this.

41:41.415 --> 41:43.209
-I'll kill you all.
-Stop!

41:43.292 --> 41:45.586
-See who's laughing now!
-Jun-hyeong, stop!

41:46.170 --> 41:48.255
Please! I'm sorry, Jun-hyeong!

41:50.466 --> 41:53.636
Let's see! Is it still funny now?

41:58.098 --> 41:59.475
Oh, it's the inspector!

41:59.558 --> 42:00.518
We're fine now.

42:01.560 --> 42:03.020
You just don't want to learn, do you?

42:08.692 --> 42:09.860
Do you remember what I said?

42:09.944 --> 42:11.153
Guilt isn't thoughts.

42:11.237 --> 42:13.447
Real guilt is something
felt with your body.

42:13.948 --> 42:14.823
Hm.

42:17.451 --> 42:18.702
That's gasoline.

42:19.328 --> 42:20.329
What the fuck?

42:20.412 --> 42:21.330
Are you scared?

42:25.000 --> 42:26.544
Isn't this what you were planning?

42:26.627 --> 42:28.504
Oh shit.

43:05.082 --> 43:07.793
Sir, please help me! Please, I was wrong!

43:09.670 --> 43:13.716
It was my fault, okay? Please save me!

43:19.471 --> 43:21.140
I was wrong!

43:21.223 --> 43:23.475
I get it, okay?

43:23.559 --> 43:25.728
I've learned my lesson!

43:45.456 --> 43:48.500
Why are you doing this to me?
I don't deserve this! Why?

43:48.584 --> 43:50.586
Ask yourself the same thing.

43:51.253 --> 43:53.547
Do you think that Dae-seok
deserved to be treated that way?

44:01.639 --> 44:05.225
Dae-seok was afraid
of dying, too, you know? Just like you.

44:07.645 --> 44:09.146
But he went through with it.

44:09.647 --> 44:12.107
And that's because of you,
you piece of shit.

44:24.620 --> 44:27.748
If you're finding it difficult
to deal with your friends bullying you,

44:27.831 --> 44:29.458
then why don't you transfer?

44:29.541 --> 44:31.919
What? Why should my son
be the one to change schools?

44:32.002 --> 44:32.961
NO PUNISHMENT FOR BULLY

44:33.045 --> 44:35.255
Why aren't you making
the ones bullying my son transfer?

44:35.339 --> 44:37.466
Why should the victim be forced to leave?

44:40.219 --> 44:43.097
Hold on. You can't
just cancel your orders now.

44:43.597 --> 44:46.850
I don't understand what's going on.
All my vendors are canceling.

44:48.769 --> 44:51.730
I messed up.
Please, just leave my father out of it.

44:51.814 --> 44:54.316
-Don't touch me.
-Stop your father, I'm begging you.

44:54.400 --> 44:55.943
I'll do what you want. I'll do anything.

44:56.026 --> 44:59.238
Look at you. I thought I was just a loser
who always cries for his daddy?

44:59.321 --> 45:00.698
I was wrong, I'm sorry.

45:00.781 --> 45:02.616
What can I do to make it up to you?

45:03.200 --> 45:04.284
I'll do anything you want.

45:06.745 --> 45:08.163
Just die already.

45:32.396 --> 45:35.357
Ensuring students fully grasp
the consequences of their actions

45:35.441 --> 45:38.944
by having the students live the torture
that they made others live through,

45:39.027 --> 45:41.864
and making sure they take accountability.

45:42.364 --> 45:44.783
That is exactly how the Bureau believes

45:46.618 --> 45:48.662
that real lessons should be learned.

45:59.423 --> 46:01.633
But no matter what lessons
you have learned…

46:04.303 --> 46:06.472
Dae-seok won't be able
to come back, right?

46:08.599 --> 46:09.725
For the rest of your life,

46:09.808 --> 46:12.436
you will carry the burden
of knowing you caused this.

46:13.395 --> 46:15.397
That's the justice he will get.

46:21.445 --> 46:23.238
This is the hell you created.

46:23.822 --> 46:24.907
Enjoy living in it.

46:41.215 --> 46:43.550
The police reinvestigated Dae-seok's case

46:43.634 --> 46:45.969
and immediately arrested Ryu Jun-hyeong
and his friends

46:46.053 --> 46:47.721
for what they did to Dae-seok.

46:47.805 --> 46:49.139
You dumb motherfucker!

46:49.223 --> 46:50.516
For the first time,

46:50.599 --> 46:54.353
Principal Kim didn't cower away,
and took responsibility for everything.

46:54.436 --> 46:57.481
Principal Kim! Have you
been hiding there the entire time?

46:58.106 --> 47:00.067
The ERPB website

47:00.150 --> 47:02.945
exposed Ryu Jun-hyeong's bullying
for everyone to see.

47:06.365 --> 47:07.449
THE LATE PARK DAE-SEOK

47:07.533 --> 47:13.288
And they say that those records can only
be erased if the victims forgive them.

47:17.543 --> 47:20.712
And that's how the Bureau
ended their stay at Daehan High.

47:26.218 --> 47:30.097
That was the last time
that we ever saw the inspector.

48:38.832 --> 48:41.627
THE LATE CHOI GA-YUN
JULY 25, 1995, TO NOVEMBER 27, 2024

48:41.710 --> 48:44.671
WE WILL NOT FORGET

49:34.930 --> 49:36.640
I'm gonna hunt you down

49:37.641 --> 49:39.685
Yeah, I ain't playing around

49:40.435 --> 49:41.979
I'mma take your crown

49:42.062 --> 49:44.439
Man, better run, gonna hunt you down

49:45.607 --> 49:47.109
Who's the bravest?

49:47.192 --> 49:50.529
Let me know how far
You wanna take this

49:50.612 --> 49:52.614
I've been having dreams of winning

49:52.698 --> 49:55.117
I can see myself
In an esteemed position

49:55.200 --> 49:57.119
I got no qualms, I got no fears

49:57.202 --> 49:59.121
I got blood, sweat and tears
Under my belt

49:59.204 --> 50:00.497
And now I'm switching gears

50:00.580 --> 50:03.125
And there's no stopping
You got no options

50:03.208 --> 50:06.211
We win by any means necessary
You got it?

50:12.050 --> 50:14.636
-I'm gonna hunt you down
-Gonna hunt you down

50:14.720 --> 50:17.639
-Yeah, I ain't playing around
-I ain't playing around

50:17.723 --> 50:19.641
I'mma take your crown

50:19.725 --> 50:21.643
Man, better run
Gonna hunt you down

50:22.394 --> 50:24.646
Yeah, I be coming for you
Like Hannibal

50:24.730 --> 50:27.649
Huh, I'm a killer, call me a cannibal

50:27.733 --> 50:29.651
Uh, I'mma take your crown

50:29.735 --> 50:32.654
Man, better run, gonna hunt you down
